{title:'I like forests and conservation',start:'Choose a local habitat and begin a repeatable, ethical fungal survey.',grow:'Contribute standardized records to a conservation or regional mapping project.'},
{title:'I like organizing and connecting people',start:'Help transcribe specimens, organize a local foray, or make research understandable.',grow:'Coordinate a community dataset, translation, collection or collaboration.'}
